# Summary

Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement [[cite:obs-e6c01bb303d89ccb8284834bc8355f1de52beafa "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]].

Each plot is of a standard size, defined as one unit of allocation in the agreement [[cite:obs-e6c01bb303d89ccb8284834bc8355f1de52beafa "Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement."]].
